WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.110
<b>We're approaching the end of another year so 
let's look back at this year's Gintama anime!!</b>

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:41.030
<b>...By drinking!!</b>

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.000
<b>You know those year-end parties where you keep drinking until you've forgotten 
everything that happened the past year? There are a few things you're not supposed to forget.</b>

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:50.090
Here's to another year!

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.040
Yeah, another year's gone by.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.130
That was so fast.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.050
Not surprising. A lot happened this year.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:59.180
A Gintama recompilation, 
producer P making noise,

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.040
more incidents than I can count.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:03.060
We're the only ones who 
would remember any of that.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.700
Well, it was a rough time,

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.030
but we can look back now and laugh about the memories.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:10.060
Let's do our best again next year, Gin-san.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.270
Don't start celebrating!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.500
What was that for, Gin-chan?

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.820
Why are you fools acting like 
the year's already over?

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.920
Uh, isn't that what this party is for?

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.450
Haven't you heard the saying that if 
you want to make it a hundred leagues,

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.950
consider ninety leagues the halfway point?

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.750
Sure, we're still on the air,

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.750
but if we get too excited and screw up,

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.460
this show will kick the can.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:35.400
We must be extremely careful 
as we take the last step.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.340
S-Sorry...

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.660
I guess I was a little too excited.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.140
I'm impressed, Gin-chan.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.350
You can stay cool at a year-end party.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.570
Now I'll play this tape so we can listen

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:48.300
to some cool and have a cool party.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.380
Sorry about hitting you, Shinpachi.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.120
Try to control yourself.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:58.720
Yes!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:02:59.960
Then I'll pour you some tea.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.870
<b>Oolong Tea</b>

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.870
Hey! You're about to get us pulled off air!

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.170
Hey! Are you already drunk?!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.460
Everyone says that you shouldn't 
let alcohol get the better of you.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.370
It's okay.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.880
I need to drink a lot more before 
I start doing anything stupid.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.330
Oh, you already started?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.880
That's cold.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.300
Oh, there you are!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.880
Hey, bring more booze! Put it on Otose's tab!

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.070
Nobody gave you permission to do that, Curly!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.180
No, the Yagyu will pick up the bill.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.040
You shouldn't spoil them.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.170
Um, the man with sunglasses 
will work off the bill.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.890
Yes! I have a job!

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.240
Is Gin-san really okay?

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.970
He only gets to drink 
himself silly once a year.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.840
I hope nothing happens.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.750
Ow...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.040
What happened yesterday?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.930
No good. Can't remember.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.500
And where am I?

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.450
Why am I naked?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.220
Hey, what is this?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:07.970
No way.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:08.480
Wait, no way.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.290
Really?

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.220
Wait, does this mean...

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.770
I passed the critical point in a Jump show!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.620
I've made a huge mistake, 
because I was drunk...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.150
<b>Indecent behavior at 6 PM!!
I was drunk...</b>

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.880
If... If the PTA finds out, we're finished!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:22.890
C-Calm down.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.210
Remember what happened yesterday.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.270
It's possible that nothing happened.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.920
Nope! Unfortunately, I 
can't remember a thing!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.310
Wait, I don't have time for that.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.290
Who is this?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.670
I can't remember that either!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.330
Hopefully, it isn't anyone I know.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.480
Please!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.500
F-Forget the critical point!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.100
I've left the atmosphere!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.020
U-Uh, sorry...

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:08.240
I-I can't remember anything...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.050
Why am I apologizing?!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.120
Why am I acting all nice?! That's disgusting!

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.830
R-Really. I can't remember anything either.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.630
Why isn't she looking at me?

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.480
Why is she acting like a woman?!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.700
Stop it, Gran!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.500
Don't play dumb!

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.340
That's perfect.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.880
Neither of us remembers.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.310
Nothing happened.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.420
I can accept that.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.890
Let's just forget about this.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:36.030
I can't just forget about this crazy event!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.150
Yeah, sorry about this.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.620
Why am I still apologizing?!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.400
I just sound like a creep!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.440
Stop it, you sound weird.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.890
Besides, it's entirely possible 
that nothing actually happened.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.380
Th-That's true.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.030
We both got drunk and fell 
asleep in the same bed.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.520
W-We should be heading home.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.790
They might be starting to worry about us.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.360
Oh, but we should probably 
go home separately.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.290
Don't want anyone to get the wrong idea.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:03.970
S-See you later.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.800
Why are we acting like this 
is some kind of office tryst?!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.310
I feel sick! I feel sick!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.810
I can't tell if it's because I'm hung 
over or because I did something nasty!

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.970
Why did this happen?!

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:25.350
I should have listened 
to Shinpachi's warning!

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.820
Everyone says that you shouldn't 
let alcohol get the better of you.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:33.120
It's only been one day, but 
now they seem so far away!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.950
Feels like it's been ages since 
we were Odd Jobs together!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.080
Can I no longer go back to 
being the normal person I was?

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.010
How am I supposed to act 
when I walk in the door?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:42.540
<b>Snack Otose</b>

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.460
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.780
And how much do they know?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.470
Damn! I can't go home!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.130
Welcome back.

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:52.660
Were you out all night, Master Gintoki?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.350
I-I wasn't out all night!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.170
But it's already morning.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.730
Y-Yes, but don't make it sound so dirty!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.340
U-Uh, when I woke up, I 
was next to a dumpster.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.690
G-Guess I had too much to drink.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.480
I never asked for an explanation.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.950
Actually, Lady Otose just 
returned and told me that

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.500
she woke up next to a dumpster.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.930
W-We weren't sleeping next 
to the same dumpster!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.460
We were in completely different places!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:16.950
We weren't sleeping together! 
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.330
What do you mean by that?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.470
Uh, er, well...

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.680
Damn, I feel sick again!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.380
Get a hold of yourself.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.670
How many more bars did you visit?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.470
W-Well, I actually can't remember.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.090
What happened?

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.870
Lady Kagura said that she was sleepy,

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.640
so Master Shinpachi took her 
home after the second bar.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:43.150
Lady Catherine keeled over at the third bar,

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.220
so I carried her home.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:48.060
Everyone was very drunk at this point.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.440
I see. Who stayed behind?

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:54.450
Lady Otose, Lady Otae, Lady 
Kyubei, and Master Hasegawa.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.700
At the third bar, you ran into the ninjas.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:01.210
And the fourth bar was going to be in Yoshiwara.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.180
A-Anyway, Shinpachi and Kagura 
don't know what happened.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.840
So I only need to worry about the adults.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:11.840
<b>Snack Otose</b>

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:09.330
It's possible that they were all so drunk 
that they can't remember anything, so what do I do?

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.050
Should I ask them?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:11.840
Master Gintoki?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.390
Either way, I can't go home before 
I've figured out what happened.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.140
I need to find out if I'm clean.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.140
But if I'm not, I still can't go home.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.560
<b>Kodokan Dojo</b>

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.560
Excuse me!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.060
Yes?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.740
G-Gin-san.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.280
Oh, yesterday was a lot of fun.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.170
I was wondering if Shinpachi made it home.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.550
H-How are you doing?

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.420
You were pretty drunk.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.910
Hey, why did you turn around?

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:39.160
N-Not really. My job requires 
me to drink all the time.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.910
Why won't she look at my face?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.410
Hey, she definitely knows something!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.870
She knows that Gran and I did the deed?!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.630
So something actually happened?!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.540
Um, I don't mind.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.620
It was the alcohol.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.510
Just a lapse in judgment.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.740
Let's forget it ever happened.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:58.450
It was a one night mistake.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.130
You liar! You obviously 
remember what happened!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:03.440
I won't tell Shin-chan.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:04.840
W-Wait!

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.420
I can't remember anything from yesterday.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.020
So I don't know what actually happened.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.830
You can't remember?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.460
Debris!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.730
Y-You violated a girl's,

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.170
violated my honor, and you can't remember?!

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.490
That's despicable!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.400
So it really was just the alcohol.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.600
I didn't think you were such a creep!

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.920
Never show your face around here again!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.490
Violated my honor?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.820
What does that mean?

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.610
Huh? Doesn't she mean Gran's honor?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:40.660
But Gran doesn't have 
any honor left anywhere.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.450
Huh?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.930
What?!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.690
Kyubei-kun! Please come out!

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.600
So I slept with Gran and Otae?!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.880
Could you please open the 
door? It can't be true!

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.070
I don't believe it! I refuse to believe it!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.210
Kyubei-kun!

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.420
I have a question!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:00.250
What happened at the fourth bar?

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:06.210
We welcome the next lord of 
the Yagyu, Master Gintoki!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.360
What did you say?

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.200
I am so grateful!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.140
Last night, you were able to convince our

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.210
lady to give up her desire to become a man!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.420
She was crying in her room this morning,

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.440
but she just made her decision!

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:23.880
Our lady has accepted her 
role as our princess!

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.990
After what happened last night,

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:29.140
I have no choice but to live as a woman.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.720
Gintoki, you must take responsibility.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.150
Ah! Where are you going?!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.320
After him!

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.850
So sorry, Yagyu-san!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.740
The phantom thief Koikage 
has stolen your groom!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:45.540
We were a team long before you ever met him!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.820
What did he steal?

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.950
That should be obvious.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.290
My precious virgi-

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.500
Runny Diarrhea hit her with his poop!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.300
They fell down!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.050
Capture Master Gintoki!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.300
What's going on?!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.010
What have I done?!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.810
Look, it's a procession of courtesans.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.880
She's a real beauty!

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:08.280
But I don't recognize her.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.060
She hasn't been around.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.400
I heard that she's going to leave Yoshiwara.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:16.530
A woman like her must have been expensive.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.540
Two hundred million.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.820
Work hard to pay it off.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:27.330
H-How many mistakes did I make in one night?!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.640
This is a lie!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.710
I can't remember any of these?!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.690
Ha-Hasegawa-san!

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:34.980
What did I do yesterday?!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:36.840
Get drunk and forget it ever happened.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.940
I'll do the same.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.970
Last night never happened.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:46.490
Y-You too...

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.770
Eh, you should be fine.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.120
I can't remember what happened,

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.960
but everyone was completely drunk.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.830
And the hostess girl was feeling sick,

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.460
so you took her to the restroom.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:03.780
Ten minutes or so passed.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:08.110
Then you finally came back and 
said that she had gone home.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.790
I remember you looked happy for some reason.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.950
Then the eye patch girl was feeling sick,

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:19.190
so you helped her and came back happy.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:20.630
The same thing happened with Sarutobi.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:26.460
But in the Yoshiwara lady's 
case, she dragged you outside.

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:30.020
Ten minutes later, you came back in 
tears with your clothes shredded.

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.310
And when you went off with the 
sunglasses guy, you took a lot longer.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.160
Twenty minutes, I think.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:41.030
And once the sun rose, you carried 
the drunk old lady off somewhere.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.710
How is that fine?!

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.530
Am I Dr. Dolittle?!

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:48.910
Considering you carried off that 
old lady, I'd have to agree.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.810
You must be a real animal lover.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.290
And I was actually victimized once!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.040
And why was Hasegawa-san twenty minutes?!

00:12:57.430 --> 00:13:00.380
The second time must have been too much.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:00.670
Bastard!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.630
You should have stopped me!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.430
What do we do now?!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.300
A different show will be airing 
in this slot in January!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.840
Calm down.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.560
There's nothing wrong with doing the deed.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:16.150
It's only wrong when you have no 
intention of taking responsibility.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.990
Everything depends on how you behave now.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.150
So man up.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.650
<b>Tenny's</b>

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.650
Huh?!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.560
You want to start a serious relationship 
that might lead to marriage?!

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:25.740
What are you talking about?!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.560
Did you hit your head on something? 
You're making me sick.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.320
I'm the one who feels sick.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.660
W-Well, I did some thinking,

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.630
and you know how I said I 
didn't remember anything?

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.170
I was actually lying.

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:40.670
Oh? So you were fully aware 
of what you were doing?

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:45.170
So, I'm saying that I'm going 
to take responsibility.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.420
Really? When you ran away, 
I was prepared to kill you.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:53.060
Princess, Master Gintoki is 
prepared to lead the Yagyu!

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.430
Y-Yeah, but you know?

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.120
We can't just get married on the spot.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.980
We should take this one step at a time.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.960
After jumping right into bed with me?!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.730
Are you toying with me?!

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.610
N-No, I'm very serious,

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.320
but I was thinking that you need time

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.990
to consider how you feel about me.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:13.660
I've already made up my mind.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.080
First, you need to fork 
over two hundred million.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.290
That money will be spent on bodyguards 
for Yoshiwara after I'm gone.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.240
W-We can talk about money some other time!

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.480
Anyway, are you sure you want to be with me?!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:23.810
I'm dirt poor!

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:24.800
Are you sure about this?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.740
I wouldn't mind falling to the 
bottom of society with you.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.050
That's how I feel now.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.670
They're all interested for some reason!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:35.670
I see.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.180
I was thinking that you could scare some

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:40.480
of them off by getting too serious.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.230
How am I getting serious?!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.350
I'm a six-timing bastard! I'm a sleazebag!

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.950
That was already true when you 
slept with six people in one night.

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:52.090
Well, this is kind of 
similar to Strawberry 100%.

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:56.620
I don't remember Strawberry 100% 
having an old lady and an old man!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.500
That would make for some traumatic images!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.080
Fanservice 0%!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:03.780
If they find out I'm a six-timing bastard, 
I'll be ripped apart in six directions.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:06.020
I should apologize now.

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:07.760
You think they'll let Bunta-san 
get away with that?

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:09.700
If they find out, they'll kill you.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.220
If you apologize, they'll kill you.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.990
There's only one way to survive.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.560
Take responsibility by going 
out with all six of them

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.430
without the others finding out.

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:22.230
If they get sick of you 
and leave, you're free.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.280
It's a short-term strategy.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:25.550
I'm willing to help.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.610
What?! Live together?!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:32.190
Y-Yeah... We might get married, 
so this is like a dry run.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.450
Why do you keep pushing on ahead?!

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:35.620
You're making me sick!

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:39.580
We won't really know each other 
until we've lived together.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.120
If you get sick of me, go ahead and leave.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:44.890
But this place would be too 
small for the three of us.

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.100
Who's the third person?

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:46.900
Shin-chan.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:48.880
And there would also be 
Kagura-chan and Sadaharu-kun.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.090
That would be a bad idea!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:54.390
We might be living together, but 
we still have our own lives.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.770
So just drop by when you can.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.140
We'll keep this our secret until I've 
straightened everything out with the others.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:15:59.440
That makes sense!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.950
Then the princess will 
take Tuesday and Thursday,

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.920
while I take Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, 
Thursday, Friday, Saturday, and Sunday!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:05.650
Why are you here every day?!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.780
I'll be at Odd Jobs during the day,

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.030
but I'll try to be here every night.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:12.970
You're only coming back at night?!

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.400
Does that mean you're only after my body?!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.290
I can probably just ignore her.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.370
D-Don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.040
I don't have anything dirty in mind.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.470
Do as you please.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.870
We can get lotioned up 
and two hundred million.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.120
Or you can two hundred 
million between my boobies.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:34.170
Or two hundred million inside me.

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.380
Take your pick.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:37.120
I don't get to choose anything!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.810
You just want your two hundred million!

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:41.640
Anyway, I'll pay the rent,

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.970
so let's not talk about money again.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:51.070
Hey! The situation has clearly gotten worse!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.120
Couples that live together usually 
end up not getting married.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.220
Think about it.

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:58.870
Who would want to spend their life with 
you after seeing how you normally behave?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.910
That doesn't mean we should put 
all six of them in one house!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.490
Don't be picky.

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:05.960
This happens to be an 
apartment my old man runs.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:06.930
You can work it out.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.700
Hey, are you really trying to help me?

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:11.760
Are you sure you're not 
just playing with me?!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.700
Don't worry.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:16.000
My favorite Jump series is the romantic comedy To Love-Ru Darkness!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.160
That doesn't make me feel better!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.260
You're going to turn this show 
into To Love-Ru Darkness!

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.970
What? I shouldn't go outside?

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:27.020
But then I can't go shopping or cook.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.840
Well, it's pretty dangerous these days.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.600
I can do the shopping.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.860
Are you worried about me?

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.750
O-Of course I am!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.930
If a pretty girl like you goes 
outside, the men will all jump you!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.830
Please, Gin-san!

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.270
But it's a housewife's duty to go shopping.

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.270
I've made up my mind.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.330
We're only together because of an accident,

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.460
but I'll do my best to support you.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:52.710
Welcome home, Darling!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:53.570
Would you like dinner?

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.880
Would you like a bath?

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.980
Or would you like me?!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.260
Oh, no. There's a hole in the wall.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.710
I'm sorry, Gin-san. Are you okay?

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.050
You're sweating so much.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.070
Was our neighbor angry?

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:06.020
I should go apologize!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.270
It's okay! I just apologized!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.460
But I should apologize in person!

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.800
I said that it's okay!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.830
The neighbor's kind of 
scary, so I got nervous.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:15.540
You shouldn't go outside!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:16.630
That person was clearly a deviant.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.950
This neighborhood is dangerous!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.240
Oh, dear. How frightening.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.770
But that scary neighbor 
must have forgiven us

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.010
because I paid my respects.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:26.970
Paid your respects?!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.220
Y-You visited everyone?

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:33.800
Yes, but nobody was home, 
so I left a present.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.590
What kind of present?

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.350
What was that? It came 
from the room next door.

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.430
Um, are you okay?

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:44.350
Why are you opening a hole 
in the wall when you knock?!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.560
Well, I thought this would be faster.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.330
That's not the problem!

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.980
Wait! We don't know what's 
wrong, so I'll check!

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:55.440
Kyubei! What's wrong?!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.010
That voice belongs to Gintoki...

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.240
Welcome home...

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.650
Save that for later! What happened?!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:06.950
<b>We just moved next door. I made a 
little too much, so please have some.</b>

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.890
There were sesame buns by the door.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.450
But it turns out that they were poisoned.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:06.950
I'm getting heartburn.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:10.420
No, that was made by your beloved Otae!

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.580
You fool!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.680
A rich person shouldn't need to eat 
food that's been on the ground!

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.630
Gin-san, is everything okay?

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.550
I just heard Tae-chan's voice...

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.590
You're hearing things now?! Hang on!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.720
I see, it was my imagination.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.650
So I still can't forget about Tae-chan...

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:26.100
D-Don't worry about it.

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.920
Anyway, if she makes any more 
noise, the others will find out.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.550
I need to shut her up.

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:32.860
H-Hold on. I'll help you throw it up.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.610
Don't touch me!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.370
I-I'm home.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.450
Hey, the door is over there.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.240
Oops, I screwed up.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.010
Gintoki, are you okay?

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:47.750
Sorry, I moved without thinking.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.980
Wait, I'll pull you out.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:50.750
You fool.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.080
What are you doing?

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:52.960
Come on now.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.380
Dinner's getting cold.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.880
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.950
You're ripping apart my body!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.190
Hold on!

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.150
I'll never get out if they both pull!

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.720
Push! Please push!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.850
Push?

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.390
Hey, Gintoki!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.600
Hold on! I'll circle 
around to the other side!

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.100
Wait!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.740
If they circle around, 
they'll see each other!

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:18.820
This is good enough.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.400
Let's have dinner.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.610
I'm starving.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.620
You must really want to eat my food.

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:26.210
D-Dinner?

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.120
But how am I supposed to feed you?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.620
Just bring me my dinner!

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.700
Okay, this is my chance!

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:37.200
No good! My waist hurts so much that 
I don't have any strength left!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.780
You see, I'm not much of a cook,

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.940
but I know how to use a hot pot.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.090
How am I supposed to eat this?!

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:48.260
Am I supposed to be Goemon?!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:51.360
I made it sweet, the way you like it.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:52.270
Enjoy.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:53.930
Enjoy, my ass!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.020
You're clearly cooking me to eat!

00:20:56.260 --> 00:21:00.010
I tried making curry, but it 
might be a little too spicy.

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:01.530
I don't know if it will suit your palate.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.530
And where is your palate?

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:06.530
Since it's curry, it 
should go here, Princess.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.510
Oh! Look, Princess!

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:15.240
He's dancing with joy!

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:19.370
That's good. He may have a sweet 
tooth, but curry should be spicy.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.640
Don't be in such a rush. Nobody's 
going to take your food.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.300
I'm glad that I made it sweet.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.020
I don't even know what's spicy or sweet!

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.300
Hey! I'm gonna die!

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:28.180
What?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.180
It's to die for?

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:32.290
Really, you like it so much? Have some more.

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.040
There's plenty more left!

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:37.770
Princess! Feed him more!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.680
This is how a married couple bonds!

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.370
Oh, are you hungry?

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:52.870
Here, have some.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.630
Okay, time for work.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.010
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>Next Episode: People Can Only 
Live By Forgetting the Bad</b>

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:41.810
Next time:

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:44.420
People can only live by forgetting the bad.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:49.610
<b>Gintoki has passed the critical point, 
and his troubles have only begun!!</b>

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>Now he must go on a date with everyone 
at the same time!! This can't go well!!</b>
